    "business_context": "Plant-level master-data viewer for MM users (master-data maintainers, production planners, MRP controllers) who need a fast, read-only inventory of semi-finished products produced or stocked at a given plant. The user enters a plant (P_WERKS) on the standard selection screen; the program enforces M_MATE_WRK display authorization for that plant, then loads up to 50 HALB materials joined with plant assignment (MARC) and language-dependent description (MAKT). The split ALV provides drill-down: clicking a material in the upper list refreshes the lower grid with that material's attributes. Typical use is a quick lookup during BOM review, costing prep, or production-readiness checks, without opening MM03 per item."
